  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 146,
    "summary": "Happy are they whose hope is in the Lord—The Lord frees the prisoners, loves the righteous, and reigns forever.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Praise ye the Lord. Praise the Lord, O my soul.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "HEB Hallelu-yah."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "While I live will I praise the Lord: I will sing praises unto my God while I have any being.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Put not your trust in princes, nor in the son of man, in whom there is no help.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "TG Trust Not in the Arm of Flesh."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 34
          },
          {
            "start": 62,
            "end": 70
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "His breath goeth forth, he returneth to his earth; in that very day his thoughts perish.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 10,
            "text": "TG Breath of Life."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Happy is he that hath the God of Jacob for his help, whose hope is in the Lord his God:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5,
            "text": "TG Happiness."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 6,
            "end": 11
          },
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 21
          },
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 66
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Which made heaven, and earth, the sea, and all that therein is: which keepeth truth for ever:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 63
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Which executeth judgment for the oppressed: which giveth food to the hungry. The Lord looseth the prisoners:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 42,
            "text": "TG Oppression."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord openeth the eyes of the blind: the Lord raiseth them that are bowed down: the Lord loveth the righteous:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "Matt. 9:30 (27–31)."
          },
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 38,
            "text": "Isa. 42:7; Matt. 11:5."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 21
          },
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 25
          },
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 28
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord preserveth the strangers; he relieveth the fatherless and widow: but the way of the wicked he turneth upside down.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 62,
            "text": "James 1:27 (25–27); D&C 136:8 (7–9)."
          },
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 72,
            "text": "Prov. 15:25."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord shall reign for ever, even thy God, O Zion, unto all generations. Praise ye the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "TG God, Eternal Nature of."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 35
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
